data: {"id": "3dce13506d054eb4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1942", "run_id": "3dce13506d054eb4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，直接分析如下：\n\n### 1. 支持候选原因（PendingUnschedulable）的证据\n\n*   **Pod 当前状态为 Pending，未调度：**\n    `kubectl_get_yaml` 返回 `phase: Pending`、`nodeName: None`，且 `conditions` 中 `PodScheduled` 的状态为 `False`。这确认了 Pod 仍处于未调度状态。\n*   **调度器明确拒绝的原因：**\n    `kubectl_get_yaml` 中 `PodScheduled` condition 的 message 为：`\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.\"`。\n    `kubectl_describe` 的 Warning 事件进一步确认：`FailedScheduling 31m default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1789037516131, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3dce13506d054eb4-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "3dce13506d054eb4", "seq": 1943, "ts_ms": 1789037525316, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 88.708, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-gtzc8"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3dce13506d054eb4-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "3517135a817282700772234b5d42dd19924059c9ec56a69cb63a70ef1a07730f", "bytes": 2451}, "snapshot_sha256": "364c1d88cd635f84160dcab717c147eb84132bd713c487f68b46dab0f815d34d"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "3dce13506d054eb4-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "3dce13506d054eb4", "seq": 1944, "ts_ms": 1789037525316, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3dce13506d054eb4-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3dce13506d054eb4", "seq": 1945, "ts_ms": 1789037532857, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.54, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1398, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8 处于 Pending 状态，未被调度到任何节点 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 调度器明确拒绝原因，指向节点亲和性/选择器不匹配。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi` / `container.resource_request.cpu: 5m` | 排除因资源请求量过大导致的节点资源不足问题。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `PodScheduled` Condition: `False` (Reason: `Unschedulable`) | 提供 Pod 停滞在 Pending 状态的直接状态确认。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` for `Pending`: `1` (0 for `Running`) | 通过时序指标佐证 Pod 长期处于待调度状态且未成功运行。 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\n- 证据 #2 显示 Pod 资源需求极低（5m CPU / 8Mi Memory），直接排除了资源耗尽作为调度失败原因。\n- 证据 #1 与 #3 共同确认：故障不是资源问题，而是**策略匹配问题**（3个节点均未匹配选择器）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了未存在于集群节点的 nodeSelector/亲和性约束 → 调度器遍历 3 个节点均无匹配 → 触发 FailedScheduling (Unschedulable) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` 因配置了**节点选择器/亲和性约束（node affinity/selector）**，且集群中所有 3 个可用节点均不满足该约束，导致 `default-scheduler` 无法找到合适节点，从而将 Pod 维持在 `Pending` 状态（证据编号：#1, #3）。\n\n该根因已通过 K8s 调度事件中的明确反馈 `0/3 nodes are available: ... didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` 得到证实。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8 处于 Pending 状态，未被调度到任何节点 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 调度器明确拒绝原因，指向节点亲和性/选择器不匹配。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory: 8Mi` / `container.resource_request.cpu: 5m` | 排除因资源请求量过大导致的节点资源不足问题。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `PodScheduled` Condition: `False` (Reason: `Unschedulable`) | 提供 Pod 停滞在 Pending 状态的直接状态确认。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` for `Pending`: `1` (0 for `Running`) | 通过时序指标佐证 Pod 长期处于待调度状态且未成功运行。 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\n- 证据 #2 显示 Pod 资源需求极低（5m CPU / 8Mi Memory），直接排除了资源耗尽作为调度失败原因。\n- 证据 #1 与 #3 共同确认：故障不是资源问题，而是**策略匹配问题**（3个节点均未匹配选择器）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了未存在于集群节点的 nodeSelector/亲和性约束 → 调度器遍历 3 个节点均无匹配 → 触发 FailedScheduling (Unschedulable) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` 因配置了**节点选择器/亲和性约束（node affinity/selector）**，且集群中所有 3 个可用节点均不满足该约束，导致 `default-scheduler` 无法找到合适节点，从而将 Pod 维持在 `Pending` 状态（证据编号：#1, #3）。\n\n该根因已通过 K8s 调度事件中的明确反馈 `0/3 nodes are available: ... didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` 得到证实。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

